atives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae07-7d67-9e24-98ca5cf0dace","description":"Di\u00f3xido de carbono","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae07-7659-9075-e70280a1c96e","description":"Nitrog\u00eanio","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae07-7ef5-9d4c-bdb0ab1bc55b","description":"Oxig\u00eanio","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae07-732c-87a9-c36a479a145c","description":"Metano","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae07-71da-9229-4c67412f2cb9","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que a paleoantropologia estuda?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"A paleoantropologia utiliza f\u00f3sseis e evid\u00eancias arqueol\u00f3gicas para tra\u00e7ar a evolu\u00e7\u00e3o dos homin\u00eddeos ao longo do tempo.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae07-796f-8f90-c6382c1728c0","description":"povos pr\u00e9-hist\u00f3ricos e as origens do ser humano","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae07-7330-a9c1-872f46269403","description":"intera\u00e7\u00f5es entre organismos e processos geomorfol\u00f3gicos","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae07-7bac-8da4-bd68e10fbafe","description":"estudo de res\u00edduos e lixo","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae07-77ef-89c9-ef4cb61fc1f5","description":"crime","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae07-7d7d-9a56-0169c289f3d9","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Que tipo de material \u00e9 o solo franco?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"O solo franco \u00e9 um tipo de terra, geralmente uma mistura f\u00e9rtil de areia, silte e argila que favorece o crescimento das plantas.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae07-7090-880e-9f2700e37c34","description":"Terra","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae07-7729-ba80-041fb557bd9c","description":"Madeira","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae07-7cc2-ab41-760577e807d3","description":"Metal","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae07-7c70-8056-020e6b22480e","description":"Rocha","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae07-71ad-8128-3cb