n":"A gravidade atrai as part\u00edculas atmosf\u00e9ricas em dire\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0 Terra, impedindo que a maioria seja levada para o espa\u00e7o; a mesma for\u00e7a rege as \u00f3rbitas planet\u00e1rias.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae08-7fb6-a488-984e92b41c46","description":"Gravidade","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae08-7b80-bce3-0a13c8dc9174","description":"Atrito","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae08-74fa-8635-bc59c299e341","description":"For\u00e7a de Coriolis","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae08-7eea-a6e5-13b3b895d688","description":"Efeito solo","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae08-79ff-a8d4-bb9c6c816969","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 o nome da grande gal\u00e1xia espiral mais pr\u00f3xima da nossa gal\u00e1xia?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"A Gal\u00e1xia de Andr\u00f4meda est\u00e1 se movendo em dire\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0 Via L\u00e1ctea e espera-se que se funda com ela em um futuro distante.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae08-7ec7-ba4d-521339e4aba7","description":"Andr\u00f4meda","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae08-7c07-b29e-dffdaf8801d7","description":"H\u00e9rcules","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae08-7b6a-9fc1-a327a576fb86","description":"Ursa","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae08-79fc-918f-76d21e50d2ae","description":"\u00d3rion","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae08-7894-86c2-ad183866671e","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Para prevenir qual doen\u00e7a a Marinha Brit\u00e2nica come\u00e7ou a distribuir ra\u00e7\u00f5es di\u00e1rias de suco de lim\u00e3o em 1795?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"O escorbuto \u00e9 causado por uma grave defici\u00eancia de vitamina C e pode levar a sangramento nas gengivas e dificuldade na cicatriza\u00e7\u00e3o de feridas.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae08-7765-bf35-792e2341b173","description":"Escorbuto","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae08-772f-b925-5c20e8aa1272","description":"Var\u00edola","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae08-771c-aceb-757359a55c28","description":"Mal\u00e1ria","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae08-729e-87ab-6141aa80a8a0","description":"Febre amarela","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae08-7d91-8d36-31105e9851d4","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual cientista realizou um teste p\u00fablico de uma vacina contra o antraz em um rebanho de ovelhas em 1881?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"O teste de Louis Pasteur demonstrou a efic\u00e1cia da vacina: as ovelhas vacinadas sobreviveram \u00e0 exposi\u00e7\u00e3o ao antraz, enquanto as n\u00e3o vacinadas morreram.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae08-72c7-9d69-9580e4c2427b","description":"Louis Pasteur","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae08-7e64-a26c-f9e223904eaa","description":"Robert Koch","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae08-79b0-8763-7da4775212f0","description":"Edward Jenner","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae08-7027-940f-a95c0233b9e8","description":"Alexander Fleming","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae08-76bd-89a4-6508f288a75b","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 o nome dado ao \u00fanico supercontinente que existia h\u00e1 200 milh\u00f5es de anos?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"A Pangeia come\u00e7ou a se fragmentar \u00e0 medida que as placas tect\u00f4nicas se deslocavam, acabando por se separar nos continentes que conhecemos hoje.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae08-71b2-9704-b388fb80c56e","description":"Pangeia","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae08-7d97-8997-016c05ac751f","description":"Laur\u00e1sia","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae08-735d-851b-5686599820be","description":"Rod\u00ednia","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae08-715f-afb8-da7991fb0857","description":"Gondwana","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae08-70cc-a1bc-6049fad19b5d","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Como se chama um veneno que atua no sistema nervoso?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"As neurotoxinas afetam as c\u00e9lulas nervosas ou sua transmiss\u00e3o de sinais. A toxina botul\u00ednica \u00e9 um exemplo; ela interrompe a comunica\u00e7\u00e3o entre os nervos e os m\u00fasculos.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae08-7a0b-8f70-7434b93aa07f","description":"Neurotoxinas","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae08-79fd-a258-a77fa640382c","description":"Neurovenenos","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae08-7e74-9b0b-b113821ba32d","description":"Endotoxinas","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae08-7cb5-a045-97dd12b5fd64","description":"Endovenomas","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae08-7167-aeaf-d4fe2fbb7651","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Quais part\u00edculas s\u00e3o emitidas pelos tubos de raios cat\u00f3dicos?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Os raios cat\u00f3dicos s\u00e3o feixes de el\u00e9trons; os estudos de J. J. Thomson sobre eles ajudaram a estabelecer que os \u00e1tomos cont\u00eam essas part\u00edculas.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae08-74a3-939d-8eb1d7335ec2","description":"El\u00e9trons","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae08-79c5-a6db-dab755d30e58","description":"\u00cdons","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae08-7c14-99aa-7c7d4250b6bd","description":"N\u00eautrons","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae08-7eda-b72f-0ac4a4d2e86e","description":"B\u00f3sons","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae08-7eb1-8ce3-4fc8ff03fb6b","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 a palavra para designar um veado macho?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"\u201cBuck\u201d tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 o termo comum para um coelho macho adulto.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae08-7f99-b86e-415e8148936b","description":"Um buck","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae08-70f8-83d5-49d238719a40","description":"Um macho","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae08-7f22-93b5-9a9